    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "You know why he did it. You've always known. You're just running away.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "No matter what that report said, if we had to do it all over again, Catrayv would make the same choice. Every time.",
            1
        ]
