    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            14
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Kamui",
            "...He noticed something was off with you way before any of us. But he didn't wanna put anyone in a tough spot.",
            1
        ]
